        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG774-630 5-5/16\" Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very modern rectangular sliding door flush pull has contemporary, clean lines. The housing between the 1/16\" thick satin stainless steel front and back plates is black high impact plastic, allowing the flush pull to be pressure mounted into the door for a clean installation (no screws). It can also be thru-bolted from the back side if used on pantry or cabinet door. For use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors. Any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG774_size.gif?v=1704354743\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Stainless Steel Flush Pull  Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-flush-door-pull-with-flush-cover-ahi-sig775-630\"><b>Rectangular Flush Door Pull with Flush Cover</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-rectangular-flush-door-pull-with-flush-cover-ahi-sig777-630\"><b>Offset Rectangular Flush Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/square-stainless-steel-flush-door-pull-with-flush-cover-ahi-sig773-630\"><b>Modern Square Flush Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/long-stainless-steel-flush-door-pull-with-flush-cover-ahi-sig771-630\"><b>Long Rectangular Flush Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG774-630 Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 5-5/16\" (135 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/16\" (55 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/4\" (19 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 21/32\" (17 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 3-15/16\" (100 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Height: 4-15/16\" (125 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width: 1-13/16\" (46 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 5/16\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-FSB-4251-630.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI-FSB-4251-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
